5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be careful not to create a system that breeds resentment among neighbors. I'll check the five years of association minutes and last year's complaint log entries.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to see if the current spots are actually fair! I'll look into the sticker register and the daily riders, and the five years of association minutes.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The physical layout and the morning rush are my concerns. I'll check the rain exposure along the parking rows and the morning departures watched from the entrance.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm curious about the financial side of things. I'll look into the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'm worried about the long-term management burden. I'll check the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
